# W31c, b (k10): joins a in stag0201, sees the notice of a's entry and does not answer; the offer closes when a leaves:
# A on its closing row goes nowhere (the box greys it); a request that crossed the close (sent for the closed offer
# while its line still shows: the development hook "goalong closed") is refused by the relay ("Couldn't go along: Kim
# left Sand Labyrinth.").
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@800
log b sees the notice
idle until offers=0 fail frames>=3000
log the offer closed
goalong until frames>=30 fail go=asked
log b's A on the closing row went nowhere
goalong closed until go=none,frames>=120 fail frames>=900,stagechange
log b's crossed request was refused
idle until frames>=60
